fact WorkItem(id: "WI-121", description: some(value: "Proposal 030 phase β.1 — SmtDischarge witness checking. Per phase β.1 of docs/proposals/030-theorem-registry.md: re-run the cached SMT-LIB document via the named backend, verify verdict matches what the witness records. Implementation: new check_smt_discharge_witness(witness, blob_dir, solver_path) -> Result<(), CheckError>. Loads the SMT-LIB document blob via cache::load_blob(blob_dir, document_hash), invokes the named solver (z3 today; cvc5 in a follow-up), parses the verdict, compares to witness.verdict. Errors: missing blob (BlobMissing), verdict mismatch (VerdictMismatch{recorded, observed}), solver unavailable (SolverUnavailable). The check runs read-only (no caching). Slot in anthill-cli/src/check.rs (creating the file) — surfaces via the existing run_check stub at main.rs:1082. Acceptance: cargo-test passes; new test verifies a Discharged ProofRecord with SmtDischarge witness checks ok via blob round-trip."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: nil), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-04-28T12:20:34Z"))
